# Versification "KJV tradition"
# Written for Epigrapho, not shipped by SIL: the King James tradition is a
# Paratext custom versification, so eBible.org carries it as a custom.vrs in
# each project rather than as one of the six standard files.
#
# It is the English versification with two amendments, both measured against
# the packs themselves in test/versification.test.ts:
#   - 3 John has fourteen verses, not fifteen: what English numbers 14 and 15
#     is one verse here.
#   - Revelation 12 ends at verse 17, and the sentence English numbers 12:18
#     opens chapter 13 instead.
#
# Used by VBL and KJV. BSB ends Revelation 12 at the same verse but keeps the
# sentence inside it, so it has its own file. The VBL line is the one
# eBible.org publishes at sillsdev/machine samples/data/VBL-PT/custom.vrs,
# word for word.
#! base = eng

3JN 1:14
REV 12:17

REV 13:1 = REV 12:18
